  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-14T12:32:38.398Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I tried testing my mahjong world using three logged-in users on different profiles. It seems, however, that the login session gets mixed up between those profiles.\nI logged in with three accounts: bd_, yuikana, and bd__test. I was able to use req invite to join yuikana to the same world as bd_, but then when I sent a req invite from bd__test to bd_, it did not arrive. I entered a portal with bd_ and yuikana, and yuikana was then logged out. When I logged back in with yuikana, bd_ was then kicked for having multiple clients in the same room.\nMulti-profile testing is essential for world development. Please fix this before release.\nOutput logs: https://www.dropbox.com/sh/2hnhldhoow6th7c/AAByNWDIlXgi1dB15vxFQFqGa?dl=0",
